{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "027yuk_401_2_4_027_01_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:ae20d943fc5bd5a13df4fc652fec906df726615d97e96f74a1d09f3717825630",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_401_2_4_027_01_09_a:2_4_027_01_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b091b3b20be6c3722474be78eabcd9433b7e179921babeb0d7c577ad023924fa",
      "text": "喂，●●●●プロデューサー？\n方便说话吗？要是忙的话，我待会儿再打过来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_401_2_4_027_01_09_a:2_4_027_01_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:daf51de2cb945c9edb2fb526b08d7917623e01c895cca6645378b57494c1ac13",
      "text": "……方便吗？\n刚好赶巧真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_401_2_4_027_01_09_a:2_4_027_01_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2531ea459ffeaa5cf1c16e976dd895655148116342ff08136b0717fd5a41ba2",
      "text": "办完演唱会后，想再次找\n●●●●プロデューサー聊一聊呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_401_2_4_027_01_09_a:2_4_027_01_09_a:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:93afa0c7369bb36fa43a6784e87da28862975c24fd4a6c315b5ed50ad45b94ef",
      "text": "一个人办演唱会的机会可不多对吧？\n回想起来，注意到了很多事呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_401_2_4_027_01_09_a:2_4_027_01_09_a:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0771fddd4eb68bcb0a29550cf3ae82f978241cda712ca92fac3ba3abddfdc372",
      "text": "比如客人们都很兴奋期待啦，\n大家都玩得非常开心啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_401_2_4_027_01_09_a:2_4_027_01_09_a:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:12b813695a117702a4058005707426d11ca3e376b2c9c7b56919bc0e9d050d39",
      "text": "还有大幕拉开之后，\n我也一直沉浸在一连串的快乐中啦，等等。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_401_2_4_027_01_09_a:2_4_027_01_09_a:cmd-000018:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17990e8e59d2e6d256f4adf0724666fdc86b9a540628adebe00dfd200ac3bfd5",
      "text": "那天我能献上最棒的款待，\n全靠在背后支持着我的你。谢谢你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_401_2_4_027_01_09_a:2_4_027_01_09_a:cmd-000019:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:90d7d4d05f94e8afd3920523efb31aa4464ad1a0475a15d88a7f63bed23dbc2c",
      "text": "不客气",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_401_2_4_027_01_09_a:2_4_027_01_09_a:cmd-000022:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b81d7e33df92441419337ed9de5ea6befc95d6043c6892e9de16547e089f026",
      "text": "呵呵，我今后也想给更多的人\n送去款待。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_401_2_4_027_01_09_a:2_4_027_01_09_a:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:163fb4e996fb987200f750d02fd807a98cb900ea9066e6748934fbe5b547d1a4",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，\n今后也拜托你了。那么，回见啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
